{"seq":1,"slug":"investment-record","title":"投资战绩","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/warren-buffett/major-works/investment-record","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-compounding-machine","title":"复利机器","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/warren-buffett/major-works/investment-record/the-compounding-machine","wordCount":1534,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"beating-the-market","title":"战胜市场","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/warren-buffett/major-works/investment-record/beating-the-market","wordCount":1363,"readingTime":6}],"introMarkdown":"# 投资战绩\n\n巴菲特最辉煌的成就，是他创造的惊人投资战绩。本章考察这一战绩的两个面向。\n\n第一篇文档讲述\"复利机器\"——他如何把伯克希尔打造成滚雪球般增长的复利奇迹。第二篇文档讲述\"战胜市场\",呈现他数十年持续跑赢大盘、挑战有效市场理论的非凡记录。\n"}